==English==

===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|sc=polytonic|νεῦρα|tr=neura|lang=grc}}, the nominative plural form of {{term|sc=polytonic|νεῦρον|tr=neuron|lang=grc}}, whence {{term|neuron|lang=en}}.

